Web app smoke after the server move and the /api/v1 addition, 2026-09-28.
Dev server on a throwaway SQLite file with throwaway SESSION_SECRET and
APP_PASSWORD_HASH exported in the shell only. Plain curl form posts.

GET / no cookie:         303 -> /login
GET /login:              200
POST /login wrong:       200 (error page rendered)
POST /login right:       cookie set
GET /                    200
GET /add                 200
GET /shopping            200
GET /trash               200
GET /recipes/new         200
POST /add?/paste         draft created
GET /                    shows the "Extracting" draft card
GET /api/v1/recipes      401 {"error":"unauthorized"}
